+ ## The standalone Windows app
+ The desktop app (ModelBox) is a **separate download** from the publisher's
+ GitHub release. No skill bundle in this catalog carries an installer: a
+ registry blocks a skill that ships an unsigned binary, so the workflow skills
+ here are the text-and-script version of the workflows and the app stays
